  boot                               ""
  held folders                       201
  notices of the first pulls         {changed root}
== a peer writes into three of them
  refresh                            ok, before the patience
  pass, notices when answered        sent
  pass, log entries read             5
  pass, folders written              3
  pass, summary                      held 201, covered 201, merged 3, entries 3, end head
  pass, notices                      {changed d:<folder1>, changed d:<folder2>, changed d:<folder3>}
  changes                            [put new.txt, put new.txt, put new.txt]
== a peer writes into a folder pulled since
  refresh                            ok, before the patience
  pass, notices when answered        sent
  pass, log entries read             3
  pass, folders written              1
  pass, summary                      held 201, covered 201, merged 1, entries 1, end head
  pass, notices                      {changed d:<folder4>}
== at once again: every folder is fresh
  refresh                            ok
  summary                            held 201, covered 0, merged 0, entries 0, end fresh
  log entries read                   0
== two refreshes while the store pends
  refresh                            ok, at the patience
  refresh during it                  ok, at the patience
  summary                            none
  log entries read                   3
  notices                            {changed d:<folder5>}
== the store down
  refresh                            ok, before the patience
  summary                            held 0, covered 0, merged 0, entries 0, end failed, error the store is down [unreachable]
  refresh again                      ok, before the patience
  summary                            held 0, covered 0, merged 0, entries 0, end failed, error the store is down [unreachable]
== an entry no reader can follow, below the tree head
  tree head passed it                true
  refresh                            ok, before the patience
  pass, notices when answered        sent
  pass, log entries read             808
  pass, folders written              201
  pass, summary                      held 201, covered 201, merged 1, entries 1, end unreadable
  pass, notices                      {changed d:<folder6>}
  f020                               [lost.txt] no read
== an entry no reader can follow, above the tree head
  refresh                            ok, before the patience
  summary                            held 0, covered 0, merged 0, entries 0, end failed, error log entry 8 cannot be followed and the tree head has not passed it [corrupt/other]
